      "writtenOn": "2022-02-24T01:01:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a reason why you are using _raw for this?\nThe idea is that you can use a logical 0 or 1 (1 is asserted), and the GPIO config can have GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW for signals that are physically inverted.\nThis decouples the signal assertion from the actual polarity of the pin.",
      "revId": "2a604ac01ed3d2da61ecdcec67a9ccecd957ef49",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
