      "message": "I\u0027m of two minds for this pin.  The keyboard signals are active high, except for KSO2.  I decided to use raw here so that the logic in each keyboard driver was unchanged.\n\nI\u0027ll add the GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW and change to using gpio_pin_set() as a separate CL.",
